<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES CLOSE OF PLAY SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES CLOSE OF PLAY SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the</p>
<p>first day of four-day Supersport series cricket matches on</p>
<p>Friday.</p>
<p>In Bloemfontein: Free State 251 (Chris Craven 64, Deon</p>
<p>Jordaan 57; Wayne Kidwell 4-54). Transvaal 6-1.</p>
<p>In Kimberley: Griqualand West 263-7 (Martyn Gidley 117) v</p>
<p>Western Province.</p>
<p>In East London: Border 254-7 (Pieter Strydom 100, Steven</p>
<p>Pope 77 not out) v Boland.</p>
<p>In Port Elizabeth: Eastern Province 221-6 (Kepler Wessels</p>
<p>61) v Natal.</p>
</text>
